message: "If you use this software in research, teaching, health technology assessment, or economic evaluation, please cite the software using the citation generated from this file."
title: "HealthEconSim: Healthcare Value and Decision Suite"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
authors:
  - family-names: "Mishra"
    given-names: "Richa"
abstract: "HealthEconSim is an interactive browser-based health economics decision-support suite for cost-effectiveness evaluation. It supports static and temporal/Markov modelling, Monte Carlo probabilistic sensitivity analysis, cost-effectiveness visualization, tornado analysis, and clinical-success or QALY-based evaluation frameworks."
keywords:
  - health technology assessment
  - health economics
  - cost-effectiveness analysis
  - decision analysis
  - Markov model
  - probabilistic sensitivity analysis
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - QALY
  - Streamlit
url: "https://health-econ-sim.streamlit.app/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ric-m-pixel/health-econ-sim"
